    "script": "# StableSwapNGLPOracle: portfolio value x dampened virtual price, in reUSD\nvp_ema_time  = 866                # the LP oracle's own deploy-time EMA on the virtual price\nlp_reusd     = lp_stable(asym_ema(vp, vp_ema_time), p, 200)\nreusd_crvusd = min(1, reusd_feed)\nlp_crvusd    = lp_reusd * reusd_crvusd\noracle       = lp_crvusd * agg\n\n# the external mark: the same LP formula on the pools' LAST TRADED prices (no EMA, no dampening, no cap)\nmarket       = lp_stable(vp, p_last, 200) * inv(bridge_last) * agg"
